On Error Goto E
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
For I=0 To 30 : Ink I mod 8 : Circle 160,100,I*3 : Next I
Ink 1 : Text 100,190,"COMPACT" : Ink 2 : Bar 10,10 To 50,37
Spack 0 To 10 : Gosub SUM10
Pack 0 To 11,0,0,160,100 : B=11 : Gosub SUM
Pack 0 To 12,8,3,200,77 : B=12 : Gosub SUM
Pack 0 To 13 : B=13 : Gosub SUM
Pack 0 To 14,16,0,64,7 : B=14 : Gosub SUM
Spack 0 To 15,40,20,90,61 : B=15 : Gosub SUM
Cls 0 : Unpack 12 : Print #1,Point(30,30);Point(100,60)
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact3_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Unpack 14,100,100
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact3_2.iff"
Double Buffer : Autoback 1 : Cls 0 : Unpack 11,40,40 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact3_3.iff"
Autoback 2 : Cls 0 : Unpack 13 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact3_4.iff"
Autoback 0 : Cls 0 : Unpack 12,0,0
Reserve As Work 20,100 : Unpack 20
Unpack 20 To 1
Unpack 15 To 2 : Print #1,Screen;Screen Width;Screen Height
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/compact3_5.iff"
Pack 0 To 16,300,0,100,100
Pack 0 To 70000
Goto FIN
SUM10: B=10
SUM: S=0 : A=Start(B) : For I=0 To Length(B)-9 : S=S+Peek(A+I)*(I mod 7+1) : Next I
Print #1,"bank";B;Length(B);S : Return
E: Print #1,"error";Errn;" at";Errl : Resume Next
FIN:
